OL,3,GNEWSARare plaques discovered in hallway
OL,4,Aof family home
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Axford, chairman of Woolley and
OL,7,FWallis, said: "The rediscovery of these
OL,8,Ftwo Xanto plaques is the sort of event
OL,9,Fthat happens perhaps once in a
OL,10,Fgeneration."
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
